eems like  next week  we'll figure it out next week we'll  figure it out let's figure it out  have a great day and here's another  problem many nutrition programs rely  on meal delivery as a source of revenue  and now that they are serving far fewer  meals  they are also facing budget shortfalls  scale listen to this  cincinnati alone is losing more than one  million dollars  a month boy nancy the numbers are really  hard to hear thank you so much  you know what ryan lopez said i think  was very striking that we're just trying  to figure it out  figure it out figure it out you know the  effects of coved we don't even think  about the ripple effect that  that persuade that pervades many many  facets of your life the financial effect  the emotional effect of not knowing week  to week  how you're going to get by the stuff we  take for granted like eating yeah  like never thinking of never thinking  you're going to be a family in that  situation  because of this virus you are yeah and  no end in sight as we sit here right now  it's  it's heartbreaking

